      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="subnav" style="translate: -34px -10px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;" data-cebt="" data-cetx="-34" data-cety="-10">
      <div class="subnav-inner">
        <a href="#message">採用トップ</a>
        <a href="#works" class="" style="">働き方・活動</a>
        <a href="#interview">ご利用インタビュー</a>
        <a href="#support">支援制度</a>
        <a href="#about">るぽについて</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header><main class="" style="translate: 8px -2811px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;" data-cebt="" data-cetx="8" data-cety="-2811">
    <section class="hero" id="about" style="translate: 50px -188px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;" data-cebt="" data-cetx="50" data-cety="-188">
  <div class="container hero-grid" data-cebt="" data-cetx="-12" data-cety="185" style="translate: -12px 185px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-cebt="matrix(1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0)" data-cetx="-8" data-cety="-46" style="translate: -8px -46px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important; transform: matrix(1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0) !important;">
      <span class="small">やさしく、ゆっくり、自分らしく。</span>
      <h1 class="heading-xl fxa_pre fxa_cpre" style="--fxa-dur: 800ms; --fxa-stag: 77ms; --fxa-dist: 40px; line-height: 1.32 !important; font-size: 77.4px !important;">
        <span style="color: rgb(105, 221, 140) !important; -webkit-text-fill-color: rgb(105, 221, 140) !important;"><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 0;">楽</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 1;">し</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 2;">さ</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 3;">を</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 4;">仕</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 5;">事</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 6;">に</span></span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 7;">、</span><br><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 8;">生</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 9;">き</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 10;">生</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 11;">き</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 12;">と</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 13;">し</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 14;">た</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 15;">自</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 16;">分</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 17;">を</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 18;">見</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 19;">つ</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 20;">け</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 21;">よ</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 22;">う</span><span class="fxa_ch" style="display: inline-block; --i: 23;">。</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead">
        るぽは、はじめの一歩に不安がある方も、少しずつ自信をつけながら通える就労継続支援B型事業所です。
        落ち着いた空間と丁寧なサポートで、「しっかりしている人」も「まだ自信が持てない人」も、
        自分に合ったペースで働く楽しさを見つけられます。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#contact" class="btn"><span>見学を予約する</span><span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a href="#works" class="btn secondary"><span>活動内容を見る</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="hero-glow" style=""></div>

      <div class="hero-card-main">
        <img src="http://127.0.0.1:5000/uploads/up_598a02d7d4.png" alt="青空を背景に微笑む女性" width="760" height="700" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card-small" style="">
        <img src="http://127.0.0.1:5000/uploads/up_c4d37b3cc1.png" alt="オフィスを案内するスタッフ" width="440" height="420" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
      </div>

      <div class="hero-float">
        <div class="stack">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

    <section class="message-section" id="message" data-cebt="" data-cetx="59" data-cety="-31" style="translate: 59px -31px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;">
