      </div>

      <div class="container message-grid" style="translate: -14px 114px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;" data-cebt="" data-cetx="-14" data-cety="114">
        <div class="reveal show in is-visible active visible in-view inview animated revealed aos-animate is-inview is-show reveal-show show-up on enter" style="translate: 12px -236px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;" data-cebt="" data-cetx="12" data-cety="-236">
          <div class="eyebrow" data-cebt="" data-cetx="-5" data-cety="-8" style="translate: -5px -8px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;">Message</div>
          <p style="color:var(--accent);font-size:14px;margin:0 0 8px;">スキルを磨きながらお試しませんか</p>
          <h2 class="heading-lg fxa_pre fxa_xl" style="--fxa-dur: 897ms; --fxa-dist: 159px; translate: -12px 3px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;" data-cebt="" data-cetx="-12" data-cety="3">
            事務サービスのプロとして<br>
            共に働く仲間を募集しています
          </h2>
          <p class="lead">
            るぽでは、軽作業・PC入力・封入作業・検品・ものづくりなど、
            一人ひとりの得意や体調に合わせたお仕事をご用意しています。<br>
            毎日完璧でなくて大丈夫。安心して通えること、少しでも前に進めることを大切にしながら、
            「働けた」という実感を積み重ねていきます。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="message-cards" data-cebt="" data-cetx="-8" data-cety="-185" style="translate: -8px -185px !important; rotate: 0deg !important; scale: 1 !important; transform-origin: center center !important;">
          <article class="message-card reveal show in is-visible active visible in-view inview animated revealed aos-animate is-inview is-show reveal-show show-up on enter" data-delay="2" style="animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none; opacity: 1 !important;">
            <div class="thumb" style="cursor: move;">
              <img src="http://127.0.0.1:5000/uploads/up_7baf91717c.png" alt="相談に応じる女性スタッフ" width="520" height="500" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            </div>
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>気軽に話せる<br>相談体制</h3>
              <span class="round-link">→</span>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="message-card reveal show in is-visible active visible in-view inview animated revealed aos-animate is-inview is-show reveal-show show-up on enter" data-delay="3" style="animation: auto ease 0s 1 normal none running none; opacity: 1 !important;">
            <div class="thumb">
              <img src="http://127.0.0.1:5000/uploads/up_2ec02b9651.jpg" alt="協力して梱包するスタッフ" width="520" height="500" onerror="this.style.display='none'">
            </div>
            <div class="meta">
              <h3>人が育つ<br>キャリア支援</h3>
              <span class="round-link">→</span>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="works" class="" style="min-height: 1171px !important;">
  <style>
    #works .features-top {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }
    #works .eyebrow {
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: .06em;
    }
    #works .heading-md {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 48px);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.35;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
      color: var(--text-strong);
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }
    #works .feature-bubbles {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }
    #works .bubble {
      text-align: center;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
    #works .bubble-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 8px 16px;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--pill);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(173, 179, 176, .12);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      letter-spacing: .02em;
    }
    #works .bubble-visual {
      width: min(100%, 280px);
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      aspect-ratio: 1/1;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #bfd4c9 0%, #fff 38%, #f2f7ff 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(173, 179, 176, .14);
      padding: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    #works .bubble-visual img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    #works .bubble h3 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 26px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }
    #works .bubble p {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 28em;
      line-height: 1.85;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    #works .center-btn {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 48px;
    }
    html.js #works .features-top {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(36px);
      transition: opacity .9s ease, transform .9s cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1);
    }
    html.js #works .features-top.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    html.js #works .bubble {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(36px);
      transition: opacity .9s ease, transform .9s cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1);
    }
    html.js #works .bubble.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    html.js #works .bubble:nth-child(1) {
      transition-delay: .08s;
    }
    html.js #works .bubble:nth-child(2) {
      transition-delay: .16s;
    }
    html.js #works .bubble:nth-child(3) {
      transition-delay: .24s;
    }
    html.js #works .center-btn {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(36px);
      transition: opacity .9s ease, transform .9s cubic-bezier(.16, 1, .3, 1);
      transition-delay: .32s;
    }
    html.js #works .center-btn.show {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      #works .feature-bubbles {
